    <string name="routine_footer">Routines are fixed steps you approve on a card when you save them; no model ever picks what a routine does, so something it reads can\'t make it act. By themselves they read, set timers and alarms, turn the flashlight on or off and save a fixed note; opening an app, a draft, maps or a new event waits for you as a Ready card. Freeing memory or storage and asking a helper are never offered.\n\nOn the lock screen the brief says the time and the weather without your town, then “Unlock to hear your day”; the rest follows if you unlock within 15 minutes. Routines go online only to Open-Meteo for the weather, and only when their card listed it. They are kept on this phone, never logged and never sent to a helper.</string>
